<title>USA: Saratoga Brands Inc 1996 earnings loss.</title>
<headline>Saratoga Brands Inc 1996 earnings loss.</headline>
<dateline>LAKEWOOD, N.J. 1997-05-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			 1995</p>
<p> Shr	  loss	  $0.14   profit	 $0.22</p>
<p> Net	  loss	859,627   profit     448,731</p>
<p> Revs		  14,694,985	     11,009,018</p>
<p> Avg Shrs	     6,279,693		1,999,772</p>
<p>NOTE: Net income from continuing operations for fiscal 1996 declined to $113,842, or $0.02 per share, compared to $281,041, or $0.14 per share, in 1995.</p>
<p>During the 1996 third quarter, Saratoga discounted operations of Cucina Classica Italiana's Lensmire Cheese Factory, resulting in losses from discontinued operations of $973,469, or $0.16 per share. This compares to earnings from discontinued operations of $167,690, or $0.08 per share, in 1995.</p>
</text>
